 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? For a three to four hour ride, about one litre per hour is a good rule of thumb. Pack water bottle and take sip every twenty minutes or so. Sipping is easier on your stomach than gulping a big drink. If the ride is more than three or four hours, yes, something light like a banana, bar or cracker. Most people can, but on long ride your energy doesn't come from breakfast alone. You' be glad you packed something.",
